<title>USA: Banco Santander files $1 bln shelf with SEC.</title>
<headline>Banco Santander files $1 bln shelf with SEC.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Santander SA filed Tuesday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf registration to sell up to $1 billion in non-cumulative guaranteed preference shares and subordinated guaranteed notes.</p>
</text>
